3546. Equal Sum Grid Partition I
Leetcode Link: https://leetcode.com/problems/equal-sum-grid-partition-i/description/?envType=daily-question&envId=2026-03-25

Intuition:
Compute total sum of grid
Store row sums and column sums
Try splitting row-wise → keep adding row sums
Check: leftSum == total - leftSum
If not, try column-wise similarly
If any split satisfies → return true, else false

Formula Thinking: 
Row split:
prefixSumRows == total - prefixSumRows
Column split:
prefixSumCols == total - prefixSumCols

Time Complexity

 O(m × n)

Space Complexity

O(m + n)

Solution:

class Solution {
    public boolean canPartitionGrid(int[][] grid) {
        int m=grid.length;
        int n=grid[0].length;
        long []r=new long[m];
        long []c=new long[n];
        long total=0;
        for(int i=0;i<m;i++){
            long sum=0;
            for(int j=0;j<n;j++){
                sum+=grid[i][j];
            }
            r[i]=sum;
            total+=sum;
        }
        for(int i=0;i<n;i++){
            long sum=0;
            for(int j=0;j<m;j++){
                sum+=grid[j][i];
            }
            c[i]=sum;
        }
        long x=0;
        for(int i=0;i<m;i++){
            x+=r[i];
            long rem=total-x;
            if(rem==x)return true;
        }
        x=0;
        for(int i=0;i<n;i++){
            x+=c[i];
            long rem=total-x;
            if(rem==x)return true;
        }
    return false;
    }
}
